message: >-
  If you use SmartPick-VLA in research, cite the software version and the exact
  experiment artifacts used in your work.
title: SmartPick-VLA
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: SmartPick-VLA
    family-names: Contributors
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-16
license: MIT
