abstract: >-
  A compact research platform for language-conditioned MuJoCo manipulation,
  action-chunk imitation learning, bounded residual reinforcement learning, and
  Real2Sim2Real preparation with a ROS 2 dry-run boundary.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - vision-language-action
  - imitation learning
  - residual reinforcement learning
  - MuJoCo
  - sim-to-real
